{"version":1,"key":"quest:86","content":{"id":86,"title":"corner-shape 是什么，使用技巧及场景是什么？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:86","type":"quest","id":86},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"corner-shape 改变盒子角的绘制方式","meta":"","excerpt":"当我们想在按钮的四个角实现特殊形状时，比如内凹的圆弧、斜切的直角，会发现 border-radius 只能画出向外凸的圆角。传统做法是用 clip-path、伪元素或 SVG mask，但这些方案都有个共同问题：它们只是视觉裁剪，不会影响盒子的实际绘制区域，阴影、背景、点击区域都无法自然跟随。 corner-shape","target":{"key":"card:743","type":"card","id":743},"citeKey":"card:743"}],"trail":[{"time":1758504938427,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1780186287490,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1780190979098,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"createTime":1758504938427,"updateTime":1758504938427,"resolvedTime":1780190979098},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1758504938427}}